  "title": "Torsk (Scandinavian Cod)",
  "description": "Torsk is a Scandinavian dish of poached and broiled cod with butter. You can use frozen cod; defrosting is not necessary.",
  "authors": [
    "DHERDEBU"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-21T23:01:27-04:00",
